        <mxCell id="c71" value="&lt;i&gt;Outlined: the NetEffect column, revenue received from the year before, less revenue moved on, less revenue never billed: -$90,138.93 in 2024, +$70,598.07 in 2025 and -$24,940.25 in 2026. A negative figure is revenue recorded below the year&#x27;s deliveries. The last sign comes from the unbilled shipments: without them 2026 would read +$19,540.86. The editor is scrolled to the foot of the query: the end of the Effects CTE and the final SELECT.&lt;/i&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#5D6D7E;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacing=2;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="648" width="860" height="57" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
